INALLY, we have one. Created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaucer345" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2002514&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495096" alt="chaucer345" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2002514)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaucer345" >chaucer345</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5661">SCP-5661</a> (&quot;The Devil and the Maiden&quot;) - The maiden wasn't probably made of iron. A story told by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495096" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3651">SCP-3651</a> (&quot;Chalk Children&quot;) - No one of them had been used to wrote on a blackboard. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6682213&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495096" alt="J Dune" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6682213)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" >J Dune</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Tales</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-7-the-woman-who-wasn-t-there">The Woman Who Wasn't There</a> - &quot;<em>Allison looked down at the hand she had just used to rewrite Robert; a hat was in it, solid black, something that looked vaguely like a fedora, but with a far wider brim.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495096" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-6-the-taking-of-dr-sinclair">The Taking of Dr. Sinclair</a> - &quot;<em>Dr. Katherine Sinclair practically threw the mug of coffee in her face.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495096" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-say-this-that-you-suffer">i say this that you suffer</a> - &quot;<em>- then, perhaps, is when she steps from the umbra of girl.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oricat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5199638&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="OriCat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5199638)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oricat" >OriCat</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ronald-reagan-cut-up-while-rapping">RONALD REAGAN CUT UP WHILE RAPPING</a> - &quot;<em>Thanks I hate it.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/repatriation">Repatriation</a> - &quot;<em>All she could do was imagine the hunger in the voice promising to wait for her.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>*GoI Formats</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/la-rue-posts-willie-s-shine">LaRue Post - Willie's shine</a> - [La Rue Macabre] &quot;<em>Alright y'all. I know y'all have been ignoring me cause I ain't got no shine, but I got some good news. I'm finally used to seein' with my one eye, so I was able to get my still up and runnin' again!</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vivarium" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6798022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Vivarium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6798022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vivarium" >Vivarium</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons">If you want more cool ACS secondary class icons</a> - Exactly what it says on the tin. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" >Dr Fishbone</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Week of November 22nd:</span></h3> <h4><span>SCPs</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4604">SCP-4604</a> (&quot;Disillusionment&quot;) - So, you too, you have experienced that, uh? Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1304786&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="TL333s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1304786)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" >TL333s</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a> (&quot;Those that do not wish to be forgotten&quot;) - Ah, yes, y'know, the ode I talked about above? It's for these exact persons. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span> hadn't forgotten.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4576">SCP-4576</a> (&quot;Protective Prickly Pal, Prixors&quot;) - And here's an example of a good Added Alliterative Appeal. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6391595&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Quadraginta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6391595)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" >Quadraginta</a></span>.</li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5949">SCP-5949</a> (&quot;Drugs and Webpages at Site-69&quot;) - No sex-related Internet page had been opened. It's strange for a Site called &quot;Site-69&quot;, but it's what happened. No drugs have been traded by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5702">SCP-5702</a> (&quot;'www.wikiflick.███'&quot;) - It seems that the Wikijump initiative have been more efficient than we initially thought. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span> have been even able to provide us a preview of the new platform.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Tales</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/from-syllables-to-lines-to-imagination">From syllables to lines to imagination</a> - &quot;<em>Am hungry, gimme a munchy!</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Sirslash47" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" >Sirslash47</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/fox-hunt">Fox Hunt</a> - &quot;<em>If you can point me in the direction of an expert, or provide some insight yourself, I would be in your debt.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/t-aint-no-sin">T'Ain't No Sin</a> - &quot;<em>Uwuu, you stiww have skin?! Teehee! No wowwies, Imma hewp you get wid of it</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2034230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="daveyoufool" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2034230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" >daveyoufool</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/chef-s-table">Chef's Table</a> - &quot;<em>When I'm cooking for myself, my diet goes to shit.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/patience">Patience</a> - &quot;<em>None of them had a ghostly Klavigar that could be anywhere or anyone she wanted to be, working tirelessly to lay the foundation.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/form-5118-e-proposal-for-reclassification">Form 5118-E: Proposal for Reclassification</a> - Something new is on the road. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deathbygin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5229982&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="deathbygin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5229982)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deathbygin" >deathbygin</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/experiment-log-5702">Experiment Log 5702</a> - The preview above pleased you? We have more! Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/guide-hub">Guide Hub</a> - A new condensed version which will give you the most important pieces of advice about how to be a member, stay a member and write things for the site. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" >TheMightyMcB</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Fanart</span></h3> <h5><span>Here you will find a selection of artists whose art output is worth following. The thumbnails are clickable.</span></h5> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/tanijathefaun/gallery">TanijaTheFaun's Deviant Art Gallery</a></span> by TanijaTheFaun</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-272-DE<br /> <em>Megalodon</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/tanijathefaun/art/SCP-272-DE-860886876"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/faun1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="faun1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-015-IT<br /> <em>The Boogeyman</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/tanijathefaun/art/SCP-015-IT-861537376"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/faun2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="faun2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(200, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(200, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-115-IT-A<br /> <em>the Duke</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/tanijathefaun/art/SCP-115-IT-A-the-Duke-863010719"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/faun3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="faun3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/bluestrike01/gallery">BlueStrike01's Deviant Art Page</a></span> by BlueStrike01</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(210, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(210, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-1981<br /> <em>Ronald Reagan Tape</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/bluestrike01/art/SCP-1981-Ronald-Reagan-Tape-862254593"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/blue1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="blue1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(50, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(50, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-087<br /> <em>The Endless Staircase</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/bluestrike01/art/SCP-087-The-Endless-Staircase-861370897"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/blue2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="blue2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(350, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(350, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-939<br /> <em>Pack Hunters</em></span><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/bluestrike01/art/SCP-939-Pack-Hunters-860987228"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/collab%3Adrakimoto%3Aart-stuff/blue3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="blue3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons">If you want more cool ACS secondary class icons</a></span> by Name</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">NECROPSAR</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/shineshadow1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="shineshadow1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">YESOD</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/shineshadow2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="shineshadow2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">CERNNUNOS</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/shineshadow3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="shineshadow3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <h1><span>Q&amp;A:</span></h1> <h2><span>Q: Can I replace a blurb that you wrote for one of my articles with my own? I'm not satisfied with it.</span></h2> <p>A: Absolutely. You will always have that option at any point.</p> <h2><span>Q: I noticed an error/typo/incorrect information and wish to correct it. May I?</span></h2> <p>A: Sure! If the changes are not limited to your own article(s) and/or are substantial changes across multiple entries, you should post in that month's discussion page and then make the changes.</p> <h2><span>Q: I wrote an article and it seems to have stuck. Can I send a blurb of mine to one of the frequent collaborators?</span></h2> <p>A: Yup! It's much easier if you come to us about it, and it gives you the control over what you want shown on the news page.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>« <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-10-2020">October 2020</a> | <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-11-2020">November 2020</a></span> | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-12-2020">December 2020</a> »</strong></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608495097" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-28736-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. with a rating above 0</div> </div> 
